-- GENERATED by scripts/gen-apply-release-1020.mjs from the paste files below - edit those, not this.
-- Run on STAGING first, check the last result grid, then on PRODUCTION only when the owner says go.
-- Works on a database at the current production state (release 1019: migrations up to 0223 + 0236 + 0237).
--
-- What it runs, in this order (each section is that file unchanged; each migration in its own transaction):
--   01  APPLY-0238.sql   Free trial: a trial studio may again create at most 2 NEW quotes / events (the three cap triggers 0211 removed from quotes come back, only when missing; sample events never count; quotes already made are kept), my_trial_limits() lists quotes again, trial terms version trial-2026-10-20.
-- No row is written or deleted: 0238 only re-creates three trigger definitions on public.quotes (only when missing)
